ments":13,"created_at":"2024-03-21T06:56:44Z"},{"number":393,"title":"sv4d,torch.cuda.OutOfMemoryError","comments":12,"created_at":"2024-08-01T08:58:34Z"},{"number":159,"title":"help! ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'scripts.demo'","comments":12,"created_at":"2023-11-22T15:10:01Z"},{"number":108,"title":"Design question: Why don't you use v-prediction target?","comments":12,"created_at":"2023-08-07T14:18:55Z"},{"number":143,"title":"How to get the text-to-video model","comments":11,"created_at":"2023-11-22T03:27:04Z"}],"discussions":[],"latest_release":{"name":"0.1.0: SD-XL 1.0 with permissive license","tag":"0.1.0","published_at":"2023-07-27T08:07:20Z","body":"## Release\r\n- Releasing two new open models with a permissive [CreativeML Open RAIL++-M license](https://github.com/Stability-AI/generative-models/blob/main/model_licenses/LICENSE-SDXL1.0) (see [Inference](https://github.com/Stability-AI/generative-models#inference) for file hashes):\r\n    - [SDXL-base-1.0](https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0): An improved version over SDXL-base-0.9.\r\n    - [SDXL-refiner-1.0](https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-refiner-1.0): An improved version over SDXL-refiner-0.9.\r\n- Sharing the technical report on SDXL is now available [here](https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.01952)\r\n\r\n![001_with_eval](https://github.com/Stability-AI/generative-models/assets/62965623/e457ed1e-e688-4da9-a625-bf16ed2c5ed2)\r\n\r\n## Contributions\r\n- #17: Setup packaging with hatch\r\n- #59: Freeze requirements for .pt13, .pt2 environments, add black formatter & automatic build tests\r\n- #57, #66: Add automatic inference tests with pytest, add codeowner\r\n- #69: Improve inference code\r\n- #68, #67, #70, #71: Update README, Licenses, model names & hashes","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}